WEBVTT

00:01.280 --> 00:08.290
<i>Can you imagine a life where you 
can't even touch the person you love?</i>

00:09.140 --> 00:14.150
<i>The curse the witch laid upon him caused 
him to take the lives of any he touched.</i>

00:14.810 --> 00:19.020
<i>His own mother distanced herself from him.
His friends called him a monster.</i>

00:19.020 --> 00:20.420
<i>Even people he'd never met spoke of him as</i>

00:20.420 --> 00:23.530
<i>"Death Incarnate who dwells in the forest."</i>

00:24.370 --> 00:29.220
<i>And yet, he doesn't feel 
the least bit lonely.</i>

00:30.000 --> 00:32.050
How many times do we have to go over this?

00:32.050 --> 00:34.760
You can't have an omelet without ketchup.

00:34.760 --> 00:35.800
It's demi-glace sauce.

00:35.800 --> 00:37.510
Why? 'Cause demi-glace sauce tastes good.

00:37.510 --> 00:39.900
So does ketchup!

00:41.220 --> 00:45.180
You guys are lucky. You can tell each 
other exactly how you're feeling.

00:45.180 --> 00:46.830
I'm jealous.

00:46.830 --> 00:50.710
Huh? If you want to say something 
to Alice, then why don't you say it?

00:50.710 --> 00:54.270
Hmm? But I'm not really 
upset with her or anything.

00:56.170 --> 00:57.550
Excuse me.

01:01.380 --> 01:02.530
Alice...

01:02.530 --> 01:05.460
Stop being so cute all the time!

01:06.570 --> 01:09.460
You're so handsome all the time, too.

01:09.460 --> 01:12.890
That wasn't what I expected 
to hear, but I'll take it!

01:12.890 --> 01:13.760
Go home!

01:13.760 --> 01:14.970
I guess this is your house, though.

02:45.010 --> 02:48.790
Episode 14
The Duke, Golf, and the Mysterious Beauty

02:47.080 --> 02:48.980
Oh, Your Grace.

02:49.530 --> 02:52.440
It's your first time, but you're so good.

02:52.790 --> 02:55.470
Would you try not to sound so weirdly sexy?

02:55.470 --> 02:57.450
I'm just playing mini-golf!

02:57.450 --> 02:58.900
You're wonderful, Your Grace.

02:59.840 --> 03:01.440
I missed.

03:01.440 --> 03:03.410
You hit it a little too hard, I see.

03:03.740 --> 03:06.360
Why golf, though?

03:06.360 --> 03:10.370
I thought it would serve to fix your lack 
of exercise, and give you a change of pace.

03:12.030 --> 03:14.560
I just wanted to play with you, Your Grace.

03:14.560 --> 03:16.250
So cute!

03:18.070 --> 03:22.060
Let's not worry about the rules. 
Just aim for the flag and hit it.

03:24.740 --> 03:26.930
That motion has nothing to do with golf!

03:34.150 --> 03:36.110
Wow!

03:36.400 --> 03:38.850
Is there anything you can't do?

03:39.410 --> 03:43.530
Perhaps I'm good at it because 
it's like sweeping with a broom.

03:44.170 --> 03:46.360
I'll show you the trick, if you like.

03:46.360 --> 03:47.870
Yes, please.

03:48.430 --> 03:52.580
Eyes on the ball, and don't look up.

03:53.020 --> 03:54.980
It will send your swing off target.

03:54.980 --> 03:55.790
Okay.

03:57.540 --> 03:58.750
Your Grace.

03:58.750 --> 03:59.880
What?

03:59.880 --> 04:03.750
Don't turn around. Just look at the ball.

04:05.020 --> 04:08.760
When we're so close, it makes me 
feel kind of hot. What about you?

04:08.760 --> 04:11.590
You're the one who got close to me!

04:14.840 --> 04:16.230
<i>Don't tell me she's stripping!</i>

04:17.540 --> 04:19.430
That's not where the ball goes, Your Grace...

04:21.010 --> 04:23.230
<i>This is a living hell!</i>

04:23.230 --> 04:24.910
<i>Golf is a scary sport!</i>

04:24.910 --> 04:26.700
Now try hitting it.

04:29.120 --> 04:31.810
Don't try to swing hard or soft.

04:31.810 --> 04:33.870
Just raise the club up and swing 
it through evenly.

04:33.870 --> 04:38.460
For instance, if you raised it this high,
 swing it through that much.

04:38.790 --> 04:40.260
<i>Not only did I not get that,</i>

04:40.260 --> 04:42.670
<i>she was flirting with me as 
casually as if she was breathing.</i>

04:43.090 --> 04:47.230
Imagine a clock. If you raised it 
to 7 o' clock, swing to 5 'o clock.

04:48.290 --> 04:50.310
Or 9 to 3.

04:50.920 --> 04:54.240
Or 12 to 12.

04:54.240 --> 04:58.020
Okay. I wouldn't swing a 
putter that hard, though.

05:01.070 --> 05:04.940
<i>Don't look up. Focus on the ball.</i>

05:05.860 --> 05:07.990
<i>Swing it through as much as you raised it up!</i>

05:15.170 --> 05:16.480
I did it!

05:16.480 --> 05:17.830
Wonderful, Your Grace.

05:17.830 --> 05:20.120
Yeah, it's so nice to learn something new!

05:20.120 --> 05:22.440
<i>Hole in One!</i>

05:22.440 --> 05:28.050
<i>All I'm doing is putting a ball into a hole</i>

05:28.050 --> 05:32.640
<i>So why, so why, is golf so much fun?</i>

05:33.080 --> 05:36.050
<i>Your bold approach</i>

05:36.050 --> 05:39.450
<i>Tee shot, make some tea</i>

05:39.450 --> 05:42.320
<i>It fell into the lake!</i>

05:42.320 --> 05:45.530
<i>You're so great, Your Grace!</i>

05:45.530 --> 05:52.250
<i>Golf, golf, let's all fall in love with golf</i>

05:56.330 --> 05:58.660
You want me to dress up like a girl?

05:58.660 --> 06:04.000
No, I want to practice makeup on your face!

06:04.000 --> 06:08.520
You know, Mom won't let me do my own makeup.

06:08.520 --> 06:11.140
And I don't want to ask the maids.

06:11.140 --> 06:12.250
Sure, if you want.

06:12.250 --> 06:14.190
That's my big brother, Walter!

06:14.190 --> 06:16.170
He's a nut, but he gets me!

06:16.170 --> 06:18.280
That doesn't sound like a compliment at all.

06:18.280 --> 06:22.150
All right, now let's get to work on your face!

06:23.750 --> 06:26.680
First the foundation, then some eyeliner...

06:26.680 --> 06:30.530
Add a wig, and then change your clothes...

06:30.530 --> 06:31.770
And we're done!

06:31.770 --> 06:32.990
Look! Look!

06:35.320 --> 06:36.250
Impossible...

06:36.740 --> 06:38.680
This is me?!

06:38.680 --> 06:40.830
Don't start taking a liking to it.

06:40.830 --> 06:45.250
Hey, why don't you go to the villa 
and show it to my dear brother?

06:45.250 --> 06:46.880
To the eldest?

06:47.550 --> 06:48.510
I'll do it!

06:48.510 --> 06:51.840
Because today, I am super-cute!

06:52.240 --> 06:55.710
I'll make him fall in love with 
me and tell Mother all about it!

06:55.710 --> 06:58.430
And then I shall become the heir!

06:58.430 --> 06:59.560
<i>He's such a scumbag.</i>

07:00.060 --> 07:01.110
Bam!

07:01.110 --> 07:03.660
I call it... Project Honeytrap!

07:03.660 --> 07:06.010
Now hurry and get ready to go, Viola!

07:06.010 --> 07:09.650
Before my cuteness fades!

07:10.280 --> 07:13.280
Well, this should be fun, at least!

07:13.280 --> 07:17.040
Ha ha! I'm so cute!

07:25.250 --> 07:27.920
I guess that one was too weak.

07:27.920 --> 07:30.400
Golf's hard.

07:30.400 --> 07:32.510
You're getting better, Your Grace.

07:32.510 --> 07:34.060
I am?

07:34.060 --> 07:37.220
There you are, Dear Brother!

07:37.220 --> 07:39.680
Viola and... who?

07:39.940 --> 07:41.810
Our new maid!

07:41.810 --> 07:44.940
She says she's a fan of yours, so I brought her.

07:44.940 --> 07:46.550
A fan? Of me?

07:46.550 --> 07:47.760
That's right!

07:47.760 --> 07:51.740
She was all, "A curse?! That's so cool! 
He's totally my type!"

07:51.740 --> 07:52.680
Oh, I see.

07:52.680 --> 07:54.380
But why doesn't she talk?

07:54.380 --> 07:57.190
She's too nervous to talk!

07:58.960 --> 08:01.840
<i>The fool has no idea what 
I've got in store for him!</i>

08:01.840 --> 08:03.450
<i>Kneel in awe before me!</i>

08:03.450 --> 08:06.000
<i>Initiate Project Honeytrap!</i>

08:07.290 --> 08:10.590
<i>Stare at me! Come on! Stare!</i>

08:20.110 --> 08:21.370
What's going on?

08:21.370 --> 08:24.240
Most men would react more if a 
girl flashed her legs, right?

08:24.240 --> 08:25.610
Is he some kind of psychopath?

08:27.050 --> 08:30.150
<i>She started showing me her legs, too.</i>

08:30.150 --> 08:32.110
<i>Is that just a maid thing?</i>

08:36.260 --> 08:39.660
Okay, I'll go find Rob!

08:39.660 --> 08:42.180
You three have fun!

08:42.180 --> 08:43.790
Wait, Viola!

08:43.790 --> 08:45.500
<i>She abandoned me already!</i>

08:45.500 --> 08:47.310
<i>This is hilarious!</i>

08:47.310 --> 08:49.710
<i>Continue feeling awkward, Brothers!</i>

08:51.650 --> 08:54.210
U-Um... want to play some golf?

08:58.760 --> 09:00.640
I'll go first, then.

09:02.410 --> 09:04.720
<i>Is it true that she's a fan of mine?</i>

09:04.720 --> 09:06.520
<i>It doesn't sound possible.</i>

09:08.290 --> 09:10.170
<i>His skills are nothing special.</i>

09:10.170 --> 09:13.690
<i>If seduction won't work, I'll need
 to think of something else!</i>

09:14.230 --> 09:17.360
<i>His Grace looks so sexy playing golf!</i>

09:20.900 --> 09:23.220
Um, you want to go second?

09:23.220 --> 09:24.220
<i>Second?!</i>

09:24.220 --> 09:25.240
You can have my second putter.

09:25.240 --> 09:25.550
<i>Second?!</i>

09:25.550 --> 09:26.390
And my second ball.

09:26.390 --> 09:26.790
<i>Second?!</i>

09:26.790 --> 09:28.000
Sound good?

09:28.000 --> 09:29.460
<i>Second!</i>

09:30.120 --> 09:31.980
<i>He's always like this!</i>

09:31.980 --> 09:34.920
<i>From the very bottom of his heart,
he mocks me for being the second son!</i>

09:34.920 --> 09:37.450
Um, you okay?

09:37.700 --> 09:37.800
<b>I'm okay.</b>

09:37.800 --> 09:37.930
<b>I'm okay.</b>

09:37.930 --> 09:39.780
<b>I'm okay.</b>

09:40.340 --> 09:43.600
<i>"If I get a hole in one, 
please go out with me"?</i>

09:43.600 --> 09:45.060
Wh... Wh... What?

09:45.350 --> 09:46.510
<i>Well?</i>

09:46.510 --> 09:51.020
<i>You may not know me well, but it must 
make you happy to hear that from a girl!</i>

10:02.580 --> 10:04.020
<i>Distance is 30.</i>

10:05.540 --> 10:07.620
<i>No wind. Oaken floor.</i>

10:15.840 --> 10:18.530
"Please marry me like you promised"?

10:18.530 --> 10:21.010
Marry you? I didn't promise that!

10:21.720 --> 10:22.760
"It's the same."

10:23.260 --> 10:24.970
"Let's have the ceremony immediately."

10:25.100 --> 10:26.730
"Prepare yourself."

10:26.730 --> 10:28.940
N-No...

10:26.730 --> 10:30.190
<b>Let's have the
 ceremony immediately.</b>

10:26.730 --> 10:30.190
<b>Prepare yourself.</b>

10:29.430 --> 10:30.190
No.

10:31.700 --> 10:32.550
No!

10:34.620 --> 10:36.260
I'm sorry.

10:36.260 --> 10:37.900
I forgot my place.

10:37.900 --> 10:38.860
<i>She's so cute.</i>

10:38.860 --> 10:40.410
<i>She pulled it over her head...</i>

10:41.040 --> 10:46.370
Um, I'm sorry if I'm just 
being arrogant here...

10:46.900 --> 10:51.580
But there's someone I'm in love with, 
so I can't give you what you want.

10:52.160 --> 10:55.180
I'm willing to be friends, though.

10:57.280 --> 10:59.790
Die!

11:00.650 --> 11:01.910
Farewell!

11:03.510 --> 11:05.260
Farewell!

11:04.140 --> 11:05.260
Aah!

11:06.290 --> 11:10.120
Her voice kind of sounded like Walter.

11:10.120 --> 11:11.480
Did it?

11:15.900 --> 11:18.920
Perhaps I wasn't cute enough.

11:19.560 --> 11:21.990
Will you instruct me further
 in the Viola Method?

11:22.240 --> 11:23.280
Nope!

11:41.810 --> 11:44.260
Don't stare so much, Zain. I'm practicing.

11:44.260 --> 11:46.220
What's the problem? You're good!

11:46.860 --> 11:48.430
Don't! You're distracting me!

11:48.880 --> 11:52.350
Cuff! I brought you juice!

11:52.580 --> 11:54.020
She's practicing.

11:54.020 --> 11:56.860
Scram, kid. Cuff doesn't like sweet stuff.

11:56.860 --> 11:59.500
I love juice!

11:59.500 --> 12:02.470
And I love you, Cuff.

12:03.360 --> 12:06.930
Careful. He might've put 
something weird in it.

12:06.930 --> 12:08.290
I did not!

12:08.290 --> 12:09.840
Stop acting like her boyfriend!

12:09.840 --> 12:11.760
You're not dating, right?

12:12.500 --> 12:14.350
We're childhood friends.

12:14.350 --> 12:15.540
That's right.

12:15.540 --> 12:16.860
"Cuff said no so fast

12:16.860 --> 12:17.940
It hurt Zain's feelings really bad

12:17.940 --> 12:18.630
Now he feels blue

12:18.630 --> 12:20.300
5-7-5, but not quite"

12:21.060 --> 12:23.380
Thanks, Hugo.

12:23.380 --> 12:25.100
I'll work hard!

12:25.100 --> 12:28.640
I'll be a big man for you, Cuff.

12:29.740 --> 12:31.100
You're funny.

12:32.110 --> 12:35.600
<i>I know Cuff only sees Hugo as a kid.</i>

12:36.720 --> 12:40.070
<i>But I really do </i>not<i> like this!</i>

12:40.530 --> 12:45.910
You need to win the heart of your precious 
Cuff soon, or Hugo might take her!

12:45.910 --> 12:47.040
Ringmaster?

12:47.040 --> 12:50.540
The customers will be 
here soon. Head backstage.

12:50.540 --> 12:52.570
We'll start the show like always.

12:52.570 --> 12:53.500
O-Okay.

12:55.370 --> 12:57.130
You've got it rough, Cuff.

12:57.670 --> 13:00.460
Not at all. Every day is fun.

13:00.740 --> 13:02.880
I love the circus!

13:03.190 --> 13:04.670
Everyone is always so happy.

13:04.670 --> 13:06.610
Glad to hear it.

13:06.610 --> 13:08.840
The circus is the best 
entertainment there is.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.890
All are welcome, both as 
performers and guests.

13:11.120 --> 13:16.340
That's why I don't care who you 
are, and I won't ask questions.

13:16.340 --> 13:18.860
But it sounds like a fun story, so I'm curious.

13:19.590 --> 13:23.860
Tell me any time you feel like it, I guess.

13:37.230 --> 13:38.880
The show's about to start.

13:39.610 --> 13:43.680
Thanks to all your work, 
we've got a packed house today.

13:43.680 --> 13:47.370
Fun. Fascinating. But safety first.

13:47.370 --> 13:48.840
Stay sharp out there.

13:49.120 --> 13:50.070
Yes, sir!

13:50.390 --> 13:52.540
<i>Win her heart, he said?</i>

13:52.540 --> 13:54.810
<i>I just can't find the right time to say it...</i>

13:55.460 --> 13:57.040
<i>If we stay here in the human world,</i>

13:57.040 --> 13:59.430
<i>somebody's going to find out 
we're witches eventually.</i>

13:59.430 --> 14:02.520
<i>Should I just disappear and leave her behind?</i>

14:03.270 --> 14:04.390
<i>No, but...</i>

14:05.120 --> 14:07.810
I don't care if I'm a human or 
a witch... as long as I'm with you.

14:10.770 --> 14:11.990
You scared?

14:12.550 --> 14:16.200
Don't worry. You've got me, 
the great Cuff, by your side!

14:16.200 --> 14:19.270
<i>She has no idea what I'm going through.</i>

14:19.270 --> 14:20.420
<i>Sure, she is cute, but...</i>

14:22.970 --> 14:24.380
If you're scared...

14:24.840 --> 14:28.340
You can always hold my hand.

14:30.580 --> 14:33.660
<i>If she's that embarrassed, 
then she shouldn't have offered.</i>

14:37.300 --> 14:38.230
It's time.

14:38.530 --> 14:40.310
Cuff, Zain, you okay?

14:41.230 --> 14:44.260
It's a "l-let's do our best" handshake!

14:51.570 --> 14:53.980
<i>I'm such a wimp.</i>

14:59.790 --> 15:02.970
Tea is ready, Your Grace.

15:02.970 --> 15:04.500
Yeah, thanks.

15:09.340 --> 15:10.490
Where am I?

15:12.970 --> 15:14.330
Excuse me. Is this seat taken?

15:14.330 --> 15:16.730
You're... Daleth?

15:18.580 --> 15:21.770
I summoned you because 
I have something to discuss.

15:22.190 --> 15:25.750
The real you is unconscious 
in the room you were just in.

15:26.170 --> 15:27.260
Your Grace?

15:29.250 --> 15:33.530
Is it my curse you wanted to talk about?

15:34.090 --> 15:38.640
That's part of it, but first 
I have a favor I wanted to ask.

15:39.500 --> 15:40.350
You see...

15:40.350 --> 15:42.670
Something feels weird...

15:42.670 --> 15:46.250
It seems Alice is concerned 
and poking your cheek.

15:46.250 --> 15:47.190
She is?

15:47.190 --> 15:48.130
Your Grace?

15:48.810 --> 15:52.230
Not the neck, Alice!

15:52.230 --> 15:54.710
That tickles!

15:57.180 --> 15:58.770
S-Sorry.

15:59.770 --> 16:01.850
It's <i>nice</i> how close you two are.

16:01.850 --> 16:03.460
Well, whatever.

16:03.780 --> 16:08.140
I want you to try and 
persuade someone for me.

16:08.140 --> 16:09.230
Persuade?

16:09.720 --> 16:13.450
Just as you humans all 
excel at different things,

16:13.820 --> 16:16.810
we witches all have magic we excel at.

16:17.940 --> 16:21.650
Be it controlling fire or 
causing plants to grow...

16:21.650 --> 16:23.840
Those are the more common types, of course.

16:23.840 --> 16:27.990
I'm looking for a witch whose 
powers are more advanced.

16:27.990 --> 16:31.630
A witch with the power 
to control time itself.

16:34.660 --> 16:37.440
From the look on your face, 
you know who I'm referring to.

16:37.440 --> 16:40.460
Yes. Zain is a magical genius.

16:40.460 --> 16:44.600
But for some reason, he hides it.

16:45.360 --> 16:49.320
If it weren't for the incident with the 
logbook, I couldn't have been sure.

16:50.480 --> 16:52.030
<i>She knew...</i>

16:52.030 --> 16:58.950
And that's why I want you to ask 
him to use his time magic again.

16:58.950 --> 17:03.830
He's so nice... He'd do 
anything a friend asked.

17:03.830 --> 17:04.500
How about it?

17:05.310 --> 17:06.330
I can't do that.

17:06.680 --> 17:09.120
I don't know about his magic.

17:09.120 --> 17:12.210
And I certainly can't if there's 
some reason he doesn't use it.

17:12.490 --> 17:16.200
Well, I thought you'd say that.

17:16.200 --> 17:18.680
He's your friend. I understand.

17:19.310 --> 17:22.250
But if you can do what I ask...

17:22.950 --> 17:25.540
I'm willing to break your curse.

17:34.720 --> 17:36.070
You can't sleep?

17:36.680 --> 17:39.040
It's nothing. Don't worry about it.

17:40.330 --> 17:41.970
We've got another performance tomorrow.

17:41.970 --> 17:43.160
Get to sleep soon.

17:43.160 --> 17:44.120
I will.

17:46.730 --> 17:48.830
Childhood friends...

17:53.100 --> 17:56.050
I've heard you're the child 
of a witch and a human!

17:56.680 --> 17:58.990
I'm Zain. What's your name?

17:59.710 --> 18:02.980
I won't give you my name until you 
apologize for throwing that rock.

18:03.430 --> 18:04.560
I'm sorry.

18:05.000 --> 18:05.770
I'm Cuff.

18:07.000 --> 18:08.050
Nice to meet you.

18:09.000 --> 18:12.030
<i>My parents sent me to live 
in the human world so that</i>

18:12.360 --> 18:15.070
<i>other witches wouldn't try to abuse my power.</i>

18:15.400 --> 18:16.690
<i>But...</i>

18:17.590 --> 18:21.330
<i>I still didn't understand the 
power of the magic I had.</i>

18:28.620 --> 18:33.560
It's just barely alive... but it's
 going to wilt at this rate.

18:37.100 --> 18:38.170
Leave it to me.

18:38.710 --> 18:41.140
I'll use my magic to fix it.

18:41.440 --> 18:43.390
Magic?

18:46.810 --> 18:48.230
It came back to life!

18:48.230 --> 18:52.530
It's easy, as long as you have my time magic!

18:52.530 --> 18:54.290
Wow! You're a genius!

18:54.290 --> 18:56.570
Yeah! It's a secret to everybody, though!

18:56.570 --> 18:59.530
I can do this, too!

19:00.110 --> 19:02.340
I stopped time and moved.

19:02.990 --> 19:04.580
Wow!

19:04.580 --> 19:06.780
I know what color your panties are, too!

19:06.780 --> 19:09.330
They're white with strawberries on them!

19:09.330 --> 19:11.460
You stopped time and looked, huh?

19:14.650 --> 19:17.170
<i>Cuff called me a genius.</i>

19:18.390 --> 19:23.180
<i>We became friends and played every day.</i>

19:24.110 --> 19:27.640
<i>But one day while we were out playing,</i>

19:27.640 --> 19:30.360
<i>our parents were found 
by human witch-hunters.</i>

19:34.080 --> 19:40.230
Cuff, don't cry! I'll use my time 
magic to bring them back to life!

19:41.620 --> 19:42.860
Can you do that?

19:43.380 --> 19:47.820
Of course I can! I'm Zain, the magical genius!

19:49.610 --> 19:52.040
<i>I wanted to see her smile.</i>

19:52.900 --> 19:53.830
<i>But...</i>

19:57.180 --> 20:03.050
<i>Even magic that can control time 
can't bring the dead back to life.</i>

20:03.370 --> 20:07.760
I'm sorry, Cuff. I couldn't 
save them with my magic.

20:08.240 --> 20:10.710
Time can't change fate.

20:10.710 --> 20:12.730
I'm sorry... I'm sorry.

20:14.420 --> 20:16.200
I'm so sorry...

20:19.020 --> 20:20.190
Don't say you're sorry...

20:21.600 --> 20:23.330
Don't say you're sorry, Zain.

20:24.930 --> 20:28.650
<i>Ever since that day, I've hated my magic.</i>

20:30.050 --> 20:33.730
I couldn't even protect Cuff's smile.

20:36.970 --> 20:39.980
Break my curse? What does that mean?

20:40.430 --> 20:41.840
Did you curse me in the first place after all?

20:41.840 --> 20:44.020
Don't get the wrong idea.

20:44.020 --> 20:46.150
What I said before was the truth.

20:46.150 --> 20:49.480
The witch who cursed you 
is gone from this world.

20:49.480 --> 20:51.310
All I can do is...

20:52.900 --> 20:53.810
What is this?

20:54.050 --> 20:58.440
I called a witch I know who 
excels at breaking curses.

20:58.440 --> 21:02.650
I don't know if they'll succeed, 
but it gives you hope, right?

21:03.260 --> 21:05.250
They'll arrive in a few days.

21:05.770 --> 21:08.860
When they're done, do me that favor, please.

21:08.860 --> 21:10.740
Wait! You can't do this!

21:11.160 --> 21:14.250
Tell me! Why do you need 
magic that controls time?

21:14.250 --> 21:15.700
Who are you?

21:15.700 --> 21:17.250
At least let me see your face!

21:18.360 --> 21:22.260
No. I'm ugly.

21:28.300 --> 21:30.040
Alice! That's dangerous!

21:30.040 --> 21:35.640
Oh, Your Grace. You hadn't woken up,
 so I was going to do CPR.

21:35.640 --> 21:39.020
The second you tried, you'd go to sleep forever!

21:39.020 --> 21:43.290
R-Right! Daleth told me she 
needed me to do something!

21:43.290 --> 21:45.150
She said a witch is coming!

21:45.420 --> 21:47.520
Calm down, Your Grace.

21:48.270 --> 21:50.730
Is that a business card?

21:58.090 --> 21:59.030
An octopus?

22:02.250 --> 22:03.780
Why an octopus?

23:34.970 --> 23:40.250
The Duke of Death and His Maid
The Duke, Alice, and the Spectral Bride

23:35.210 --> 23:39.540
"The Duke, Alice, and the Spectral Bride."
